    "text": "By Mandy Travis ,\n1 hours ago Forney ISD Virtual Academy: Pioneering Flexible Learning in Kaufman County. The Forney Independent School District (FISD) is redefining education with its innovative Virtual Academy, a fully accredited online learning program tailored for students in grades 5 through 12. This initiative not only meets the demands of a modern education but also provides a flexible alternative for students who thrive in a technology-driven environment. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
